[8:30p.m.] #IkoroduRoad #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is very good coming in from the Dorman Long Bridge inwards Fadeyi, on to Onipan, Palmgrove, Obanikoro, Anthony, Idiroko, Harbour works, through the Independence Tunnel, then the Odo-Iyalaro Bridge, to Ojota Bus stop and the Interchange.

Our men are strategically located along this route to ensure that traffic unhinderred.

